## Syntax file for ChangeLog. Written for Jeorje.
##
syntax "ChangeLog" "(^|/)(ChangeLog|CHANGELOG|Changelog)(\.txt)?$"

color cyan "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}.*"
color cyan "^(Mon|Tue|Wed|Thu|Fri|Sat|Sun) .*"
color green "^[[:space:]]+\*[[:space:]][^:]*:"
color magenta "<[^>]+@[^>]+>"
color yellow "\([^)]*\)"
color red "^[[:space:]]*(Fix|Fixes|Fixed|Add|Added|Remove|Removed|Update|Updated|Change|Changed)\>"
